gust 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>CBSC</strong>\u00a0official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> UR/ OBC/ EWS/ Male </strong>: <strong>\u20b9 675/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC/ ST/ Female (All Category)</strong>\u00a0: <strong>\u20b9 180/-</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">Bihar Police CSBC Driver Constable Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 20 August 2025</h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age :\u00a0<strong>20 Year</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :\u00a0<strong>25 Year General (Male)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age :\u00a0<strong>20 Year</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :\u00a0<strong>27 Year BC/EBC (Male)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age :\u00a0<strong>20 Year</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :\u00a0<strong>28 Year BC/EBC (Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age :\u00a0<strong>20 Year</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :\u00a0<strong>30 Year SC/ST (Male/Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>CSBC</strong> provides age relaxation for the<strong>\u00a0Bihar Police Driver Constable\u00a0position</strong> as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">4361 Post</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9762662687323163\" type=\"d7beaa94e568a16f3d82d6f0-text/javascript\"></script>\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9762662687323163\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7596594071\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display:block\"></ins>\n<script type=\"d7beaa94e568a16f3d82d6f0-text/javascript\">\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n</script>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a class=\"apply-button\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n</div>\n<style>\n        /* Button Style */\n        .apply-button {\n            text-align:center;\n       